  "question": {
    "text": "A vessel of depth $2 \\mathrm{~d} \\mathrm{~cm}$. is halffilled with a liquid of refractive index $\\mu_{1}$ and the upper half with a liquid of refractive index $\\mu_{2} .$ The apparent depth of the vessel seen perpendicularly is -",
